# AI Resume Analyzer

An AI-powered Resume Analyzer built using Python and Streamlit.

## Project Overview
AI Resume Analyzer helps users analyze their resumes by comparing them with a given job description.

## Features
- Upload resumes in PDF format
- Extract resume text
- Match resume skills with job requirements
- Calculate resume match percentage
- Identify missing skills
- Provide resume improvement suggestions
- Suggest suitable job roles
- Download analysis reports

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Streamlit
- PyPDF

## How to Run

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Install the required dependencies.
3. Run the application:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

## Project Type
Python-based AI application.
